WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.725
Muthassi always laughed before the end of her own stories.

2
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:10.829
You meant to record her. There was always next Sunday.

3
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.499
The photos were on the old phone.

4
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.717
The story gets told a little differently every year.

5
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.048
[Daughter] Amma, what was Muthassi like?

6
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.314
Now, the same life…

7
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.320
…where, one evening, you pressed keep.

8
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.098
[Muthassi's laugh, and the child laughing with her]

9
00:00:45.248 --> 00:00:46.448
[giggles]

10
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:52.059
Some things you can't get back. Start keeping them today.

